  triage:title "HttpRouteKind to HTTP_ROUTE_SPECS lookup is runtime .expect(), not compile/test-time exhaustiveness-checked" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-core/src/api.rs:143-148 route_spec(kind) resolves via linear .find().expect() scan of HTTP_ROUTE_SPECS instead of an exhaustive match; a new HttpRouteKind variant wired into route_kind_for_request but missing an HTTP_ROUTE_SPECS entry compiles cleanly and only panics at runtime. Re-confirmed present unchanged by ruthless-boundary-qa at the current worktree HEAD 1daef214 (existing record was last triaged at c326cbe7)." ;
